ce-roadmap-general-zlevels-name = Z-Levels
ce-roadmap-general-zlevels-desc = Stairs leading to roofs, pits leading to the abyss. Vertical gameplay that Space Station 14 has been lacking.

ce-roadmap-guard-hard-labor-name = Hard Labor
ce-roadmap-guard-hard-labor-desc = Instead of prison cells and taking away the player's gameplay, offending citizens will be sent to work off their debts to society through various manual labor under guard supervision... And they will have the opportunity to escape from there.

ce-roadmap-farming-basic-farming-name = Basic Farming
ce-roadmap-farming-basic-farming-desc = Growing and harvesting plants, vegetables, fruits and mushrooms at a basic level.

ce-roadmap-engineering-machine-construction-name = Machine Construction
ce-roadmap-engineering-machine-construction-desc = Using brass and iron, create various devices, from machine drills to trading platforms. Multi-stage assembly, disassembly, destruction and repair of mechanisms.

ce-roadmap-engineering-powernet-name = Power Crystals
ce-roadmap-engineering-powernet-desc = Arcane energy stored in every living creature and concentrated in the world as power crystals. Both useful and extremely dangerous element. Use it as batteries for tools, run brass insulating pipes to power entire buildings and factories, or use it as a weapon against your enemies.
